aws-data.plist.gz in this directory is data.plist from
davidfsmith/AWS-OmniGraffle-Stencils (26.04.30/Resource Icons/Storage.gstencil),
a stencil known to open and draw in OmniGraffle. The builder uses it only as the
diagnostic control: one of its image graphics, re-pointed at our faceplate. Its
licence follows, verbatim from the repository's LICENSE.md. The copyright line
there is an unfilled template - {{{year}}} and {{{fullname}}} are theirs, not a
fault in this copy. The repository belongs to davidfsmith on GitHub.

out/diagnostics/4 AWS original.gstencil is that repository's
26.04.30/Architecture Service Icons/Blockchain.gstencil, unmodified, shipped as
the control for whether a given OmniGraffle draws embedded PDFs at all. The
same licence covers it.

